# Portal version sync (incoming)

Each live suite app keeps a `version` on its entry in `src/data/apps.ts`.
That field must match the sibling app's own `package.json` version — it is
not invented here.

| Portal `id` | App |
|-------------|-----|
| `atlas` | Atlas of Wisdom |
| `journey` | Journey to Great Harmony |
| `words` | Words of Sages |
| `stories` | Little Stories, Great Insights |
| `compass` | The Inner Compass |
| `cayce` | Star-Bearing |

When a sibling app ships, agents update the matching `version` here and
**commit + push** this repo. If you change a version in `apps.ts` by hand,
keep it equal to that app's `package.json` on disk / on its default branch.
